WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,230 --> 00:00:02,020
boss

2
00:00:02,070 --> 00:00:03,870
Could this be the legendary refining medicine?

3
00:00:04,030 --> 00:00:05,270
It just smells unusual

4
00:00:05,550 --> 00:00:07,070
I don’t know how it will taste after drinking it.

5
00:00:08,190 --> 00:00:10,110
Who told you this is for drinking?

6
00:00:11,270 --> 00:00:12,710
What else?

7
00:00:15,120 --> 00:00:16,440
These things belong to the foreigner

8
00:00:16,600 --> 00:00:18,160
This is to prevent you from having a dream while refining your weapons.

9
00:00:18,520 --> 00:00:20,320
To prevent you from being beaten to death by accident

10
00:00:21,890 --> 00:00:24,050
Okay, everyone, go away and don't disturb me.

11
00:00:25,170 --> 00:00:29,780
This thing is difficult to practice

12
00:00:30,310 --> 00:00:31,350
They think it's easy

13
00:00:31,870 --> 00:00:35,080
It's because I have strong enough control. Let's change it to someone else.

14
00:00:36,340 --> 00:00:37,580
This pot will be ruined long ago

15
00:00:38,540 --> 00:00:40,500
Kick the brain power boost brought by powerful kicks

16
00:00:41,330 --> 00:00:42,930
Allow me to do this kind of fine work

17
00:00:43,250 --> 00:00:44,850
Do it as naturally as breathing

18
00:00:45,210 --> 00:00:46,850
Boss, is it necessary?

19
00:00:47,170 --> 00:00:48,170
What's the use of practicing these?

20
00:00:51,060 --> 00:00:52,460
It looks like I still need to teach you.

21
00:00:52,460 --> 00:00:53,700
How to learn to be obedient

22
00:00:54,020 --> 00:00:56,060
Learn what it means to do something else is not worth it
